			"notes": "## What's Changed\n\n### Features\n- fire EntityTameEvent and PlayerBedEnter/LeaveEvent ([`acae2b0`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/acae2b0))\n- 构建面板改版 ([`a754dd0`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/a754dd0))\n\n### Bug Fixes\n- log scheduled-task exceptions at SEVERE with stack trace ([`1bfc9c8`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/1bfc9c8))\n- point entity class mappings to relocated craftbukkit package ([`4650ef1`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/4650ef1))\n- resolve plugin library loading via Libby and Paper LibraryLoader ([`eb2349b`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/eb2349b))\n- map LONG_JUMPING pose to Bukkit Pose.LONG_JUMPING ([`455ebd7`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/455ebd7))\n- broadcast name/style changes from Bukkit boss bars ([`dec89c9`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/dec89c9))\n- implement generateTree via Feature.place with Paper-aligned capture ([`87706b0`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/87706b0))\n- bridge Libby addURL without --add-opens (BUG-004) ([`a6352b2`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/a6352b2))\n- alias PlayerChunkMap$EntityTracker -> ChunkMap$TrackedEntity ([`a2774aa`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/a2774aa))\n- alias EntityType.r() official-name direct NMS call (stop-gap) ([`8197d0c`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/8197d0c))\n- 构建数据加载失败时显示真实报错与重试按钮 ([`209ed51`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/209ed51))\n- 作者列改用 GitHub 昵称/登录名 ([`1a8ab2a`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/1a8ab2a))\n\n### Refactors\n- migrate three plugin-manager @Overwrite stubs to @Inject ([`bd68338`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/bd68338))\n\n### CI/CD\n- include MC and mod version in build artifact name ([`bdb8714`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/bdb8714))\n\n### Documentation\n- README 补充构建看板与 CI 构建号说明 ([`17e04eb`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/17e04eb))\n- README 新增 CI 构建状态徽章 ([`f54f33b`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/f54f33b))\n\n### Tests\n- add integration-test source set with manual server scaffold ([`aaaa5c6`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/aaaa5c6))\n\n### Chores\n- bump mod_version to 2026.10.2 ([`9ac0e1d`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/9ac0e1d))\n- alias Citizens navigation factory a(int) -> method_6336 (probe, no-op) ([`67a76d8`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/67a76d8))\n- remove stale 1.17 TODO stubs and dead comment blocks ([`1639ae6`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/1639ae6))\n\n---\n\n### Contributors\n\n- llz162652 (`21`)\n\n**Total commits:** 21"
