			"notes": "## What's Changed\n\n### Features\n- rework /cardboard commands, add i18n, colored console, plugin enable/disable ([`43df45c`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/43df45c))\n\n### Bug Fixes\n- daemon-ize leftover login thread, drop debug leftovers ([`fe6d06b`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/fe6d06b))\n- stop leaving non-daemon threads to keep the JVM alive after stop ([`7a539cc`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/7a539cc))\n- give the detached sign snapshot a level before writing its text ([`373a39e`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/373a39e))\n- pass correct arguments into the NMS ray trace API ([`226bf16`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/226bf16))\n- correct stale facts in docs and config samples ([`4b667f3`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/4b667f3))\n- correct loader version and mappings, harden library loading ([`9196681`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/9196681))\n- detect mixin annotations stored in RuntimeInvisibleAnnotations ([`cf233f6`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/cf233f6))\n\n### Configuration\n- disable runtime mixin conflict scan by default ([`abe84b1`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/abe84b1))\n\n### Documentation\n- fix stale Javadoc referencing the removed /cardboard conflicts ([`9efe734`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/9efe734))\n- correct user-guide wording and a misleading .gitignore comment ([`1ee3fad`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/1ee3fad))\n- drop hardcoded stats and private-path references ([`3b25078`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/3b25078))\n- add Mixin conversion patterns and decision tree ([`bbdfe10`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/bbdfe10))\n- document /cardboard and /plugins commands ([`b0a7dd3`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/b0a7dd3))\n- mark the legacy commented blocks in PluginClassLoader ([`99ba12b`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/99ba12b))\n- explain the per-plugin compatibility shims in the code ([`07a6775`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/07a6775))\n- state the fork's scope honestly and add the root-cause rule ([`0bcec10`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/0bcec10))\n\n### Chores\n- bump mod_version to 2026.10.1 ([`ce880e2`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/ce880e2))\n- normalize Cardboard logger names to dotted form ([`ad9f8d9`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/ad9f8d9))\n- remove the upstream author's local debug dump and an unused class ([`afc5fff`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/afc5fff))\n- fix release workflow default, tighten contributor docs ([`ba1bc88`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/ba1bc88))\n- fix invalid ./ gitignore patterns and ignore local dev artifacts ([`6b82faa`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/6b82faa))\n\n---\n\n### Contributors\n\n- llz162652 (`22`)\n\n**Total commits:** 22"
		},
