			"notes": "## What's Changed\n\n### Features\n- member-name translation for Denizen-style NMS reflection (reobf bridge) ([`8a8fd80`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/8a8fd80))\n- add fatCitizens gradle task to bundle Citizens runtime deps ([`d357dc9`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/d357dc9))\n- load plugin dependencies from plugins/libraries fallback directory ([`c576cc7`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/c576cc7))\n\n### Bug Fixes\n- remove double stopServer call in onServerExit that hung on second save ([`c7d5638`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/c7d5638))\n- getPermission NPE regression - full takeover with HEAD+cancel ([`a3f6677`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/a3f6677))\n- fully take over methods with HEAD+cancel to avoid NPE from original body (regression from overwrite refactor) ([`3a1ed98`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/3a1ed98))\n- repair build after mixin refactors (add GPL header, fix getPlugins inject descriptor) ([`ec9a72c`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/ec9a72c))\n- close InputStream in remappedFindClass (resource leak) ([`4fdac3b`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/4fdac3b))\n\n### Refactors\n- replace 3 more low-risk @Overwrite mixins with precise @Inject ([`696965f`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/696965f))\n- replace 3 low-risk @Overwrite mixins with precise @Inject ([`fefc95f`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/fefc95f))\n\n### Documentation\n- document offline libraries directory for offline dependency loading ([`76813b9`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/76813b9))\n- add Java 21 JVM flags section for runtime reflection plugins ([`f9b774b`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/f9b774b))\n- remove emoji from README for cross-platform rendering ([`5deb6e0`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/5deb6e0))\n- fix language toggle button rendering (drop flag emoji, use plain text) ([`f9dc458`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/f9dc458))\n- honest AI-dev statement (build-checked & smoke-tested, not manually reviewed) ([`cd60082`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/cd60082))\n- support 1.21.11 only; drop stale plugin compatibility table ([`0a7335c`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/0a7335c))\n- add DeepSeek Harness link to README ([`0b629b8`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/0b629b8))\n- declare AI-assisted development (Trae SOLO, OpenCode, DeepSeek Harness) ([`dde9039`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/dde9039))\n\n### Chores\n- bump version to 2026.9.1 ([`ca6dca7`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/ca6dca7))\n- keep plans/ directory local-only ([`cf031eb`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/cf031eb))\n- keep maintainer-only docs local (modrinth CI/CD notes, issue analysis) ([`800167f`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/800167f))\n\n### Other\n- Revert \"feat: add fatCitizens gradle task to bundle Citizens runtime deps\" ([`6fbd5d2`](https://github.com/SharkMI-0x7E/CardBoard/commit/6fbd5d2))\n\n---\n\n### Contributors\n\n- llz162652 (`22`)\n\n**Total commits:** 22"
